  <item>
    <title>S1E18:没去成Dice Con桌游展？我们帮你云逛展</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/64f0a9c63fa4090b74cf0eef</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">64f0a9c63fa4090b74cf0eef</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 31 Aug 2023 22:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>本期嘉宾：花开老师（B站ID：花开未果的桌游空间）、入江老师（B站ID：入江江_）</span></p><span></span><p><span>亚洲最大的桌游展Dice Con又回来了！今年Dice Con上有什么值得玩的游戏？哪些游戏值得买？在今年的DC展上尝试了不少桌游后，我们帮你排排雷，给你推荐今年我们玩到的不错的游戏。</span></p><span></span><p><span>【时间轴】</span><br><span>PART 1:我们仨今年展会上最喜欢的游戏</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="459">07:39</a> Twinkle Starship</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="570">09:30</a> Red Wood （红树林）</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="712">11:52</a> Ancient Knowledge（亘古真知）</span><br><span></span><br><span>PART 2:今年我们觉得不错的原创游戏</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="963">16:03</a> 傀儡城</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1071">17:51</a> 倾天演义</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1231">20:31</a> 灰尘乐园</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1403">23:23</a> 文明废墟</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1569">26:09</a> 沙拉大师/肉品大师</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1754">29:14</a>九张牌桌游合集第1季</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1926">32:06</a> 铁幕·潜袭</span></p><span></span><p><span>PART 3:今年的代理游戏里不错的</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2078">34:38</a> 5分钟地牢</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2133">35:33</a> oink四小盒</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2286">38:06</a> 终焉帝国</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2475">41:15</a> 渗透因子</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2600">43:20</a> 滑板之夏</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2735">45:35</a> Rauha劳哈创世</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2849">47:29</a> 岁月史书</span></p><span></span><p><span>PART 4：日本游戏展区的好玩游戏</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3043">50:43</a> 指感觉/看感觉/色感觉</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3172">52:52</a> Matching 4U</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3361">56:01</a> American Book Shop</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3453">57:33</a> JURATA</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3526">58:46</a> Saving Princess</span></p>]]></description>
